  "citation": "Rotty R M; Marland G H (1984): Production of CO2 from Fossil Fuel Burning by Fuel Type, 1860-1982. Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/FFE.NDP006",
